(:kif (comment False "An instance of TruthValue (q.v.).  False is the logical notion of falsehood.  That is, the term 'False' is used as a sentential constant of CycL that is false under every model theoretic interpretation.  For example, (booleanResult T/F False) means that the result obtained from the true-or-false test T/F is False.  Cf. True.")
