(:kif (comment True "An instance of TruthValue (q.v.).  True is the logical notion of truth.  That is, the term 'True' is used as a sentential constant of CycL that is true under every model theoretic interpretation.  For example, (booleanResult T/F True) means that the result obtained from the true-or-false test T/F is True.  Cf. False.")
