(:kif (comment completeExtentDecidableForValueInArg "(completeExtentDecidableForValueInArg PRED VALUE ARGNUM) means that when the            CycInferenceEngine                                                                                 is asked a closed query of the form (PRED ... VALUE ...) where VALUE appears in the                  ARGNUMth position, either it can prove (PRED ... VALUE ...) without transformation,                  or (not (PRED ... VALUE ...)) is true.")
