(:kif (comment xor "The LogicalConnective that represents exclusive-or in CycL. Unlike or, which is a VariableArityRelation, xor takes two arguments, which must be instances of ELSentence-Assertible. (xor P Q) means  one but not both of P and Q is true. (An EL formula that mentions \n  xor is translated during canonicalization into an equivalent, less compact, formula that mentions or, and, and not).")
