(:kif (comment ArgGenlQuantityBinaryPredicate "Those instances of both ArgTypeBinaryPredicate and ArgGenlAttributePredicate used to specify the required quantity of an argument of Relation.  Each instance PRED of this collection is a binary predicate with the following properties: ARG1 is an instance of Relation, and ARG2 is an instance of Quantity.  (PRED ARG1 ARG2) means that some argument of ARG1 is constrained to be subsumed by (via quantitySubsumes) ARG2, where PRED determines the argument place in question.")
  :monotonicity :DEFAULT
  :original-tv :TRUE-DEF
  :original-source-file "tiny_kb.pldata"
