(:kif (comment BookkeepingPredicate "A PredicateType whose instances are predicates used to make assertions about the reification (or \"creation\") and internal representation of particular CycL terms (usually constants) in the Cyc system.  Bookkeeping predicates neither specify nor constrain the semantics of CycL terms.  Examples include  myCreator, myCreationTime, termOfUnit, and defnSufficient.  Many (but not all) bookkeeping predicates are also MetaKnowledgePredicates (q.v.).")
