(:kif (comment CycLAtomicTerm "The collection of all atomic CycLDenotationalTerms (q.v.).  \"Atomic\" here means not constructible  from other CycL terms via the syntax of CycL.  Thus, subcollections  of CycLAtomicTerm include CycLConstant, CycLVariable, and SubLAtomicTerm.  Note that CycLAtomicTerm, like most instances of CycLExpressionType, is \"quoted\" (see quotedCollection).")
