(:kif (comment CycLDeducedAssertion "The subcollection of semantically well-formed CycLAssertions that are supported by at least one argument which is a deduction by Cyc's inference engine, as opposed to having been explicitly asserted to Cyc. A given assertion can have more than one argument, and can therefore be both a CycLAssertedAssertion and a CycLDeducedAssertion.")
