(:kif (comment CycLNonAtomicReifiedTerm "The subcollection of CycLReifiableNonAtomicTerms that are reified in the KB. Example: (JuvenileFn Dog).  Counterexample: (JuvenileFn Platypus), because that term is not currently reified in the KB.  These are often called NARTs, which stands for 'non-atomic reified term'.")
