(:kif (comment CycLOpenNonAtomicTerm "The collection of denotational CycLNonAtomicTerms that have free variables. Examples: `(JuvenileFn ?X)', `(JuvenileFn ?X ?Y ?Z)'.  Counterexample: `(TheSetOf ?X (objectHasColor ?X GreenColor))'.")
