(:kif (comment CycLPropositionalSentence "The collection of CycL sentences that express propositions (see Proposition).  Two necessary conditions for a CycL sentence's expressing a proposition is that it be closed (see CycLClosedSentence) and not violate any applicable arity constraints (see CycLSentence-Askable).")
