(:kif (comment CycLReifiedDenotationalTerm "The collection of denotational terms in the CycL language which are\nreified in the KB.  Examples include Muffet and (JuvenileFn Dog); a\ncounterexample would be (JuvenileFn Platypus) because that term is not\ncurrently reified in the KB.  These are often called 'FORTs', which stands for\n'first-order reified terms'")
