(:kif (comment CycLRepresentedAtomicTerm "A specialization of CycLAtomicTerm.  An instance ATOM of CycLAtomicTerm is also an instance of CycLRepresentedAtomicTerm just in case ATOM is explicitly represented in the CycL language (as opposed to being represented in SubL, the underlying implementation language of the Cyc system).  Important specializations of CycLRepresentedAtomicTerm include CycLVariable and CycLConstant.")
