(:kif (comment CycLRuleAssertion "The subcollection of semantically well-formed CycLAssertions whose formulas are rules.\nMore precisely, the formulas are not\nGAFs (see CycLGAFAssertion), so they either have more than one literal (and therefore are\nnon-atomic) or they quantify over some free variables (and therefore are non-ground).\nAny free variables are implicitly universally quantified.")
