(:kif (comment ELRelation "A specialization of MacroRelation (q.v.) instances of which appear only at the \"epistemological level\" (or EL) of the Cyc system.  Each instance of ELRelation is associated, via the expansion or expansionDefn relation, to a sentence template to which the former is essentially equivalent and for which the former serves as a convenient alternative.  Some assertions using instances of ELRelation are irretrievable after being input to the Cyc System (ELRelation-OneWay), and others' EL forms are reconstructed dynamically by the system (ELRelation-Reversible).")
  :monotonicity :DEFAULT
