(:kif (comment FixedArityRelation "A specialization of Relation.  A Relation is an instance  of FixedArityRelation just in case it takes a fixed number  of arguments.  Most relations reified in the Cyc ontology are  of fixed arity.  For example, likesAsFriend always takes two  arguments and pointOfContact three.  This collection is  disjoint with VariableArityRelation.")
