ssor relation of the list itself.  Technically, List is more specific than Tuple only in that the index set (see tupleIndexSet) for a given list must be the counting numbers in their usual order (or some initial segment thereof), whereas the index set for a tuple, generally speaking, might be any set whatsoever.\"]).")

