(:kif (comment Percent "A variable-arity MathematicalFunctionOnScalars (q.v.).  When applied to a number or other NumericInterval (pair of numeric-intervals), Percent returns the instance of IntervalOnNumberLine that is its argument (the interval between its two arguments) divided by 100.  For example (Percent 110) is 1.1, and (Percent 10 20) is (Unity 0.1 0.2): the interval between 0.1 and 0.2 inclusive.")
