(:kif (comment PlusAll "A NumericQuantifier function that takes a SetOrCollection and a UnaryFunction as its arguments. (PlusAll <b>SETORCOL FUNC<\/b>) is the result of adding up the results of successively applying <b>FUNC<\/b> to each element of <b>SETORCOL<\/b>.  For example:\n<pre>\n    (PlusAll (TheSet 4 9) SquareRootFn)\n  = (PlusFn (SquareRootFn 4) (SquareRootFn 9))\n  = (PlusFn 2 3)\n  = 5.")
  :monotonicity :DEFAULT
  :original-tv :TRUE-DEF
