(:kif (comment ScalarPointValue "A specialization of ScalarInterval (q.v.).  Each instance of ScalarPointValue is a specific number or quantity, as opposed to a range of numbers or quantities (cf. ScalarProperInterval).  Instances of ScalarPointValue include all reals numbers and other Number-Generals (q.v.), as well as specific instances of Quantity such as (Meter 3) and (SecondsDuration 10).")
