ple of the former case see thereExists; for the latter case see TheSetOf.  (If there are no free occurrences of VAR inside SENT, then (SCOPINGRELN VAR SENT) is a \\\"vacuous\\\" application of SCOPINGRELN that means exactly what SENT means.)\n<p>\nInstances of ScopingRelation include all of the Quantifiers and Lambda.\"]).")

