ral relationship between collections and their \"intensional criteria for membership\" in the above sense is not something that is currently represented explicitly in the Knowledge Base (though this seems a worthwhile area for future work); still the comment and other \"definitional\" assertions on a given collection should ideally convey a reasonably clear and precise idea of its associated membership criterion.)")))
