(:kif (comment SubLList "A collection of list-denoting expressions that are not represented in CycL (i.e. they are not CycLConstants or CycLNonAtomicTerms) but are represented in SubL, the underlying implementation language of the Cyc system.  Each instance of SubLList is a sequence of SubLListOrAtoms (q.v.) enclosed in parentheses.  SubL lists are those things that pass the defnIff LISTP. Note that this collection is \"quoted\" (see quotedCollection).")
