(:kif (comment SubLNonVariableNonKeywordSymbol "The collection of all SubLSymbols except SubLVariables (q.v.) and SubLKeywords (q.v.); a subcollection of CycLClosedAtomicTerm.  Note that `symbol' has a very specific, technical meaning in SubL; SubLNonVariableNonKeywordSymbols are rarely used in CycL assertions, except within those built with certain CycInferenceDescriptorPredicates like defnIff. Examples of SubL non-variable non-keyword symbols include the symbols `GENLS' and `CYC-SYSTEM-NON-VARIABLE-NON-KEYWORD-SYMBOL-P'.  Note that this collection, like most instances of CycLExpressionType, is \"quoted\" (see quotedCollection).")
