(:kif (comment TheEmptyList "An instance of ListWithoutRepetition. TheEmptyList is a list that has no members (see listMembers).  Note that any list that has no members is identical with TheEmptyList; thus TheEmptyList is the only list whose length is 0.  Note also that TheEmptyList is a sublist (see subLists) of every list.  Note finally that TheEmptyList is not the same as TheEmptySet (q.v.).")
