(:kif (comment TheList "TheList is a function that combines its arguments into a list.  For any ITEM(1), ..., ITEM(n), each of which is an instance of Thing, (TheList ITEM(1) ... ITEM(n)) gives the instance of List-Extensional whose first member is ITEM (1), ..., and whose last member is ITEM(n). Note that in general ITEM(1), ..., ITEM(n) do not have to be distinct, though they do if (TheList ITEM(1) ... ITEM(n)) is an instance of ListWithoutRepetition.")
