VAR SENT)<\/code> will be itself be open (see CycLOpenNonAtomicTerm) and thus will not denote anything.  Given that a true sentence is satisfied by <i>everything<\/i>, we stipulate that <code>(TheSetOf VAR SENT)<\/code> is undefined whenever <code>SENT<\/code> is closed in order to avoid commitment to a \\\"universal set\\\". \n<p>\nSee also TheSet, which is used to specify a set by enumerating its elements.  And see TheCollectionOf.\"]).")

