(:kif (comment and "A LogicalConnective that represents conjunction in CycL. It is a VariableArityRelation, taking an arbitrary number of ELSentence-Assertibles as arguments.  <code>(and P Q ... Z)<\/code> is true if and only if all of the sentences <code>P<\/code>, <code>Q<\/code>, ..., and <code>Z<\/code> are true.")
