(:kif (comment comment "A DocumentationPredicate (q.v.) that is used to relate a CycLIndexedTerm (usually a CycLConstant) to a SubLString containing an English explanation of the term's meaning and use, as an aid to humans (whether Cyclists or not) browsing the Cyc Knowledge Base.  <code>(comment TERM STRING)<\/code> means that <code>STRING<\/code> is a piece of Cyc documentation that explains the meaning and use of <code>TERM<\/code>.  For example, the passage you are reading now is the comment for the CycL constant `comment'.  See also cyclistNotes.")
  :monotonicity :DEFAULT
  :original-tv :TRUE-DEF
  :original-source-file "tiny_kb.pldata"
