fier).\n<p>\nFor example, <code>(relationAllExistsCount anatomicalParts Dog Leg 4)<\/code> means that all dogs have four legs.\n<p>\nCf. relationExistsCountAll, and see the NoteAboutUseOfRuleMacroPredicates.\"]).")

