(:kif (comment relationExpansion "ARG2 is a CycL expression which indicates the meaning of expressions in which the relation ARG1 is the operator (i.e., in which ARG1 is in the 0th argument position).  In ARG2, the variables ?arg1, ?arg2, ?arg3, ?arg4, and ?arg5 correspond to the objects in the argument positions 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5, respectively, in expressions which have ARG1 as the operator.")
