(:kif (comment requiredArg2Pred "A MetaPredicate for stating that every  instance of a given collection is related (as the \"arg2\") to some  thing or things by a given predicate.  (requiredArg2Pred COL PRED)  means that for every instance INST of COL, there exists some sequence  <X1, X3, ..., Xn> of such that (PRED X1 INST X3 ... Xn) holds.  For  example, (requiredArg2Pred Side objectSides) means that every  side is the side of at least one object.  See also requiredArg1Pred.")
