(:kif (comment salientAssertions "(salientAssertions TERM ASSERTION) means that ASSERTION has been deemed one of the assertions most useful to examine when one is trying to figure out the intended meaning of TERM.  Thus, ASSERTION will normally contain TERM, and should be something that has been asserted on its own in the KB as well.  Statements using salientAssertions are primarily intended for human consumption, and are not normally used by the Cyc inference engine.")
