(:kif (comment CycInferenceAnswerJustification "A specialization of CycInferenceDataStructure.  Each\ninstance of CycInferenceAnswerJustification is a component of one or\nmore CycInferenceAnswers, and, in each case, encodes a complete set\nof supports (cf., CycSupportDatastructure) for that answer's binding\nlist.  See also CycInferenceBindingsDataStructure.")
