(:kif (comment EvaluateSubLFn "<code>(EvaluateSubLFn SUBL)<\/code> denotes the SubL term resulting from the invocation of the SubL EVAL facility on the expression <code>SUBL<\/code>.  For example, <code>(EvaluateSubLFn (ExpandSubLFn () (+ 1 2)))<\/code> evaluates to 3.  See ExpandSubLFn for a way to denote SubL within CycL.  See also trueSubL.")
