(:kif (comment ReformulatorDirectivePredicate "The collection of Predicates which can affect the\nbehaviour of the CycLReformulator or its submodules.  When\nreformulator directive GAFs are asserted, they are only relevant to\nthe reformulator when it is reformulating expressions in the\nmicrotheory in which the directive is asserted, or a specMt thereof.")
