(:kif (comment assertedPredicateArg "(assertedPredicateArg OBJ N PREDICATE) means that a ground atomic formula (or \"GAF\"; see CycLClosedAtomicSentence) whose initial (or \"0th\" argument-place) term denotes PREDICATE, and whose Nth argument-place term denotes OBJ, is asserted in the Cyc Knowledge Base. Note that this predicate is itself notAssertible (q.v.), since it must be computed from the state of the knowledge base.")
