(:kif (comment indexicalReferent "(indexicalReferent INDCONCEPT THING) means that in the context of the assertion, the IndexicalConcept INDCONCEPT has the referent THING.  This is a StrictlyFunctionalSlot, in keeping with the idea that the predicate will return one and only one 'value' for the second argument place at any given point in context space.  However, be advised that the arg2 will change from context to context.")
