(:kif (comment notAssertibleMt "(notAssertibleMt MT) states that the Microtheory MT cannot be used as the microtheory of an assertion made to the KB; i.e., MT might be a microtheory used as scaffolding or one whose assertions are known to be complete.  See also notAssertibleCollection, and notAssertible.")
