(:kif (comment ratioOfTo "The predicate corresponding to QuotientFn.  (ratioOfTo NUM-1 NUM-2 NUM-3) holds just in case the ratio of NUM-1 to NUM-2 is NUM-3; that is, just in case  (QuotientFn NUM-1 NUM-2) = NUM-3.  For example, (ratioOfTo 1 2 0.5) is true because 1 divided by 2 is 0.5.")
  :monotonicity :MONOTONIC
