(:kif (comment reformulationPrecondition "(reformulationPrecondition DIRECTION PRECONDITION RULE), asserted in\nthe microtheory MT, means that the CycLReformulator may only use\nRULE in MT in the DIRECTION direction (reformulating the 'from' arg\ninto the 'to' arg) if PRECONDITION holds.  PRECONDITION must be a closed CycL query, which will be asked during reformulation, and either proven true or fail to be proven.")
  :monotonicity :MONOTONIC
  :original-tv :TRUE-MON
