  :original-cnf (() ((comment ruleAfterAdding "Whenever a new rule is asserted, ruleAfterAddings are called on each literal of the rule.  The particular ruleAfterAddings called depend on the predicate of the literal.  (ruleAfterAdding PRED HOOK) means that HOOK will be called on each of the rule's literals whose predicate is PRED.  If the rule has multiple literals containing predicate with ruleAfterAdding, the order of execution is not guaranteed.  Also, ruleAfterAddings are retriggered on the addition of new arguments to an existing rule.")))
  :original-formula (comment ruleAfterAdding "Whenever a new rule is asserted, ruleAfterAddings are called on each literal of the rule.  The particular ruleAfterAddings called depend on the predicate of the literal.  (ruleAfterAdding PRED HOOK) means that HOOK will be called on each of the rule's literals whose predicate is PRED.  If the rule has multiple literals containing predicate with ruleAfterAdding, the order of execution is not guaranteed.  Also, ruleAfterAddings are retriggered on the addition of new arguments to an existing rule.")
