(:kif (comment termChosen "(termChosen TERM) is true for any closed Cyc TERM, and indicates that TERM has been chosen from the set of terms in the universe of discourse.  This predicate is primarily used on a variable so that the moment of choice of a particular term as the binding for that variable can be identified.  There should never be methods for generating bindings for non-closed termChosen literals.")
